      <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Cosmic-settings Dependencies</bridgehead>
      <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>
          <para>rustc, cargo-c, bluez, cosmic-icons, cosmic-randr, iso-codes, dav1d,
            fontconfig, freetype, gettext, xkeyboard-config, desktop-file-utils,
            wayland, libxkbcommon, pipewire, pulseaudio, and libinput</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-settings</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-settings for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="pre">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release --no-default-features --features \
 "a11y avif cosmic-comp-config page-accessibility page-about page-bluetooth page-date page-default-apps \
 page-display page-input page-legacy-applications page-networking page-power page-region page-sound \
 page-window-management page-workspaces systemd xdg-portal wayland single-instance wgpu"
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-settings /usr/bin/cosmic-settings &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/*.desktop /usr/share/applications/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 resources/com.system76.CosmicSettings.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo/ &amp;&amp;

cp -rv resources/icons/* /usr/share/icons/hicolor/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 resources/polkit-1/rules.d/cosmic-settings.rules \
  /usr/share/polkit-1/rules.d/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 resources/polkit-1/actions/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Users.policy \
  /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

